      ],
      "interpretation": "Null point skips publication and callback; restored checkpoint remains. Route exact PH to highs, all other kinds to lows; append original point. Only exact PH participates in primary ownership. Record raw physical source index/time pair. Callback gate is non-null rather than truthiness. Replay primary confirmation to native Order owner. Refresh MBL for every restored checkpoint in list order after callbacks. Compute first bullish reversal only if aggregate highs is truthy.",
